# The video page's "show fps" switch: a small frame rate readout in the full game's corner.
from rich
view full
tab settings
click "video"
expect no-node FpsReadout
click "show fps"
wait 1
expect node FpsReadout
shot fps_counter
expect fits
tab home
expect node FpsReadout
shot fps_home
tab settings
click "show fps"
expect no-node FpsReadout
